---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="At GOTYOU, we develop technology that empowers communities and local businesses, eliminating big tech intermediaries.">
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content: center;">
      <span class="token-trail"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span></span>
      About Us
    </div>
    <h1>Technology that empowers communities and local businesses</h1>
    <p class="lede">Our platform fosters secure, direct relationships between businesses and consumers, eliminating big tech intermediaries.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="content-narrow">
      <p>At GOTYOU, we develop technology that empowers communities and local businesses. Our platform fosters secure, direct relationships between businesses and consumers, eliminating big tech intermediaries. By keeping value within local communities, we're creating a self-sustaining ecosystem built on trust, connection, and growth.</p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>At GOTYOU, we empower local businesses and consumers to thrive in a digital economy built on trust, transparency, and connection. Our platform fosters direct relationships, protects privacy, and enables instant, real-time rewards. By simplifying local commerce and keeping value within communities, we're creating a marketplace that strengthens local businesses and ensures everyone benefits.</p>

      <img src="/images/gotyou-rewards.png" alt="GOTYOU mission" />

      <h2>Our Journey</h2>
      <p>For over 25 years, our founder has been on a mission to revolutionize how small businesses thrive in the digital age. Backed by a world-class team of engineers, marketers, and operational experts, we're tackling the greatest challenge local businesses face: building meaningful, lasting connections with consumers.</p>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">25+</div><div class="l">Years our founder has worked on local business technology</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card"><div class="n">222%</div><div class="l">Rise in advertising costs over the past decade</div></div>
      </div>

      <p>As e-commerce giants dominate and advertising costs soar, brick-and-mortar businesses are left behind. GOTYOU changes the game. Our platform delivers enterprise-level tools—powered by cutting-edge AI—to local markets, enabling small businesses to personalize offers, create real-time rewards, and drive demand without breaking the bank.</p>
      <p>We're here to level the playing field, empowering small businesses to compete, grow, and lead in today's digital economy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta">
    <h2>Ready to Join the Movement?</h2>
    <p>Whether you're a business owner or a consumer, GOTYOU has something for you.</p>
    <div class="cta-btns">
      <a href="https://app.gotyou.co/sign-up" class="btn-primary">
        Get Started as a Merchant
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" style="vertical-align:-2px"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
